lit experiment\b 200 Gravitational potential\b 276 Diffraction gratings\b 203 Orbiting under gravity\b 277 The orbital period\b 278 Chapter 15: Stationary waves\b 210 Orbiting the Earth\b 279 From moving to stationary\b 211", "char_count": 1718}
