{"id": "c9702_v1_u0_c0_pdf576_1647", "book_title": "Cambridge International AS and A Level Physics Coursebook (2nd edition)", "author": "David Sang, Graham Jones, Gurinder Chadha, Richard Woodside", "unit_no": null, "unit_name": null, "chapter_no": null, "chapter_title": "Acknowledgements", "section": null, "content_type": "acknowledgements", "book_pages": [564, 564], "pdf_pages": [576, 576], "text": "The authors and publishers acknowledge the following sources of copyright material and are grateful for the permissions\n\ngranted. While every effort has been made, it has not always been possible to identify the sources of all the material used, or to trace all copyright holders.  If any omissions are brought to our notice, we will be happy to include the appropriate acknowledgements on reprinting. Cover David Parker/SPL; Chapter 1Liufuyu/Thinkstock; 1.1 Edward Kinsman/SPL; 1.2 Yves Herman/Reuters/Corbis; 1.12", "char_count": 515}
